<title>USA: Omnicare gets Northwest Pharmaceutical.</title>
<headline>Omnicare gets Northwest Pharmaceutical.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare Inc said in a statement received on Monday it acquired the assets and business of privately-owned Northwest Pharmaceutical Service.</p>
<p>Northwest Pharmaceutical, a nursing home pharmacy provider based in Port Orchard, Washington, has revenue currently running at an annualized estimated rate of $6 million.</p>
<p>Omnicare, headquartered in Cincinnati, Ohio, provides professional pharmacy and related consulting services for long-term care facilities.</p>
</text>
